    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can One Gorilla Beat 100 Men?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fur of an unstoppable gorilla and answer the internet's most chaotic question. In this fast-paced, ragdoll-fueled arcade brawler, you're dropped into a nonstop brawl where men just keep coming\u2014and your fists do the talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, punch, and pummel your way enemies in an over-the-top frenzy and mayhem. Go for the classic 100-man challenge or see how long you can survive in unlimited mode. There are no waves, no breaks\u2014just you, pure muscle, and a crowd of unlucky humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive gameplay makes it easy to pick up and hard to put down. Whether you're jumping in for a quick session or chasing high-body-count glory, it's pure, primal chaos from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Gorilla</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change up your gorilla\u2019s look with a full range of options \u2014 mix and match skin color, fur color, shorts, ties, glasses, and hats to make your fighter stand out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a gorilla in a hilarious brawler</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch and pummel endless enemies in brutal, chaotic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes: Beat 100 men or face an unlimited onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant action, no fluff\u2014just pure arcade fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll physics make every fight wild and unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear your rear with a hilarious fart-poop blast that sends foes flying behind you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pound your chest to unleash a powerful shockwave, forcing all nearby enemies to step back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly re-playable with short, intense gameplay sessions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can one gorilla beat 100 men? There\u2019s only one way to find out.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can One Gorilla Beat 100 Men?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fur of an unstoppable gorilla and answer the internet's most chaotic question. In this fast-paced, ragdoll-fueled arcade brawler, you're dropped into a nonstop brawl where men just keep coming\u2014and your fists do the talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, punch, and pummel your way enemies in an over-the-top frenzy and mayhem. Go for the classic 100-man challenge or see how long you can survive in unlimited mode. There are no waves, no breaks\u2014just you, pure muscle, and a crowd of unlucky humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive gameplay makes it easy to pick up and hard to put down. Whether you're jumping in for a quick session or chasing high-body-count glory, it's pure, primal chaos from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Gorilla</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change up your gorilla\u2019s look with a full range of options \u2014 mix and match skin color, fur color, shorts, ties, glasses, and hats to make your fighter stand out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a gorilla in a hilarious brawler</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch and pummel endless enemies in brutal, chaotic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes: Beat 100 men or face an unlimited onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant action, no fluff\u2014just pure arcade fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll physics make every fight wild and unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear your rear with a hilarious fart-poop blast that sends foes flying behind you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pound your chest to unleash a powerful shockwave, forcing all nearby enemies to step back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly re-playable with short, intense gameplay sessions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can one gorilla beat 100 men? There\u2019s only one way to find out.</strong></p>",
